<article class="narrow prose">
  <h1>About My 1 Secret</h1>
  <p class="lede">My 1 Secret is a blog and community forum built around a simple idea: everyone has one piece of hard-won advice they wish someone had told them sooner.</p>
  <h2>The blog</h2>
  <p>Our editorial team publishes in-depth guides on the topics our readers ask about most: <a href="/blog/topic/renting/">renting and apartment life</a>, <a href="/blog/topic/home-design/">small-space design</a>, <a href="/blog/topic/insurance-claims/">renters and homeowners insurance claims</a>, <a href="/blog/topic/texas-living/">living in Texas</a> and <a href="/blog/topic/lifestyle/">everyday lifestyle</a>. Every article is open for comments, and readers can mark the guides they found helpful.</p>
  <h2>The community</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/forum/">forum</a> is where readers ask questions, share what actually worked for them and vote the most useful answers to the top. It is organized into communities by topic, and the <a href="/forum/one-secret/">One Secret</a> community is for posting the single best tip you know.</p>
  <h2>How we keep it useful</h2>
  <p>Posts are ranked by the community's votes. Moderators remove spam, self-promotion and anything that breaks our <a href="/community-guidelines/">community guidelines</a>. Community posts are personal experiences and opinions, not professional advice: for legal, financial or insurance decisions, talk to a licensed professional.</p>
